 vendored crate's declared licence and its licence and notice files are
 reproduced in /usr/share/doc/niri/LICENSE.dependencies. Those licences are
 permissive (MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD, ISC, Zlib, Unicode-3.0, Unlicense, 0BSD)
 or weak copyleft (MPL-2.0; crates offered as "MIT OR Apache-2.0 OR
 LGPL-2.1-or-later" are used under MIT or Apache-2.0), all compatible with
 GPL-3.0-or-later for the combined binary.

